WEBVTT

00:12.012 --> 00:14.305
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

00:14.389 --> 00:15.682
I checked everywhere,

00:15.765 --> 00:17.851
but no CCTV cameras
cover the rooftop at all.

00:17.934 --> 00:21.438
But one from the next-door building
might capture a small part of it.

00:21.521 --> 00:23.523
Can you explain and show me?

00:23.606 --> 00:24.524
Of course.

00:24.607 --> 00:26.234
The quality is terrible though.

00:26.317 --> 00:28.570
-You can barely make anything out.
-Okay.

00:28.653 --> 00:30.071
-Let's see.
-Yes, sir.

00:32.615 --> 00:33.575
This is it.

00:34.075 --> 00:36.119
-Can you zoom in?
-Yes.

00:46.504 --> 00:48.048
What if someone was here?

00:49.966 --> 00:52.135
What if someone pushed him off?

01:18.703 --> 01:20.288
What brings you here?

01:20.955 --> 01:22.415
Isn't it chaotic at the ERPB?

01:22.499 --> 01:25.126
It's more chaotic in my mind.

01:27.128 --> 01:29.756
I'm wondering
why you came back to this school,

01:29.839 --> 01:31.966
reported bullying as soon as you arrived,

01:32.050 --> 01:34.677
and are doing this now.

01:39.182 --> 01:40.433
Have you done your homework?

01:44.604 --> 01:45.438
Oh, sorry.

01:46.022 --> 01:47.398
I sounded like a salesperson.

01:48.191 --> 01:49.984
If you know what's going on,

01:50.485 --> 01:51.694
I can tell you everything.

01:52.737 --> 01:55.198
I know you want the ERPB gone.

01:55.281 --> 01:56.533
And why would that be?

02:02.122 --> 02:03.498
Probably because of this.

02:07.168 --> 02:09.712
Heart Pills most recently.
Butterfly Pills two years ago.

02:10.880 --> 02:11.965
What are they now?

02:12.048 --> 02:13.591
Diamond.

02:15.260 --> 02:16.886
I guess you don't have any proof.

02:16.970 --> 02:19.681
Otherwise, you'd have called the police
or arrested me.

02:19.764 --> 02:21.975
But here you are, chatting away with me.

02:24.602 --> 02:27.021
You and Ms. Choi

02:27.522 --> 02:29.566
were made for each other.

02:30.066 --> 02:32.986
You're so alike, sticking your nose
in other people's business.

02:33.069 --> 02:35.572
I wonder if you'll share the same fate.

02:48.334 --> 02:49.335
Hey.

02:49.836 --> 02:52.213
Why are you here?
I said I'm not coming to school.

02:52.297 --> 02:53.381
You punk.

02:53.464 --> 02:56.593
Did you expect me to just say,
"Okay, sure, take care"?

02:56.676 --> 02:58.178
That wouldn't do.

02:58.261 --> 03:00.180
Hey, wait. Come here.

03:00.847 --> 03:03.683
Every time you skip school,
you're injured like this.

03:03.766 --> 03:06.227
Oh, that looks pretty bad.

03:06.311 --> 03:08.146
-Let me put some cream on it.
-I'm fine.

03:08.229 --> 03:09.647
Just stay still.

03:12.275 --> 03:13.276
Let's see this side.

03:14.027 --> 03:16.738
I don't know what you've been up to,

03:16.821 --> 03:18.740
but do it at school.

03:18.823 --> 03:20.408
It's the safest place, okay?

03:20.909 --> 03:22.785
The safest place? Since when?

03:22.869 --> 03:24.537
It's not just me.

03:24.621 --> 03:26.873
Lots of teachers
are trying to make it safe.

03:26.956 --> 03:29.542
We'll make school a safe place. I promise.

03:30.460 --> 03:32.003
Here, promise.

03:34.047 --> 03:35.548
That's how you break a finger.

03:37.675 --> 03:38.801
You little punk.

03:39.385 --> 03:41.221
Fine, don't come. I won't either.

03:41.304 --> 03:43.973
I'll follow you around forever.
You think I'm bluffing?

03:44.057 --> 03:46.059
You know what my boyfriend calls me?

03:46.142 --> 03:49.312
Flypaper.
Once I catch you, I never let go.

03:49.395 --> 03:52.357
I'm coming to pick you up
tomorrow morning. Got it?

04:06.120 --> 04:08.831
Hey, Gyu-cheol. Good morning.

04:08.915 --> 04:11.417
Hey, come on. Breakfast…

04:11.501 --> 04:12.794
Gyu-cheol.

04:14.504 --> 04:16.506
Wait. Oh, come on.

04:16.589 --> 04:17.757
-Cho Gyu-cheol.
-Yes?

04:17.840 --> 04:19.342
I'm his homeroom teacher.

04:19.425 --> 04:20.969
You're students, right?

04:21.052 --> 04:22.387
-Put that out.
-Fucking hell.

04:23.846 --> 04:24.973
Gyu-cheol, come on.

04:25.056 --> 04:26.015
-Let's go.
-See you.

04:26.099 --> 04:27.517
-Don't look.
-We'll call you.

04:42.699 --> 04:44.826
Hey, what the hell are you thinking?

04:45.326 --> 04:48.496
The Samgeori guys who came at you
are now after your ass.

04:48.579 --> 04:50.623
Are you seeing that bitch, Choi Ga-yun?

04:52.709 --> 04:55.253
Do you know what Ms. Choi made me realize?

04:56.629 --> 04:59.340
The school is full of people.

04:59.424 --> 05:01.259
So? What about it?

05:01.342 --> 05:03.886
Imagine they were all customers.

05:03.970 --> 05:04.929
-Get inside.
-Nice.

05:05.013 --> 05:09.225
It'd be easy to dodge the cops
and move the product back and forth.

05:09.934 --> 05:11.519
Best of all,

05:11.602 --> 05:14.981
we'd get hundreds of new customers
every year.

05:22.989 --> 05:23.906
Oh man, it's cold.

05:23.990 --> 05:24.824
Ms. Choi.

05:29.245 --> 05:30.163
Gyu-cheol.

05:30.246 --> 05:31.706
You're in uniform.

05:32.582 --> 05:35.001
I figured I'd come to school properly now.

05:35.084 --> 05:36.919
Hey, that's a great decision.

05:37.003 --> 05:39.130
That's a good boy.

05:40.715 --> 05:43.343
I won't touch your hair
since you have your own style.

05:43.426 --> 05:46.346
You haven't eaten, have you?
Want to grab some gimbap?

06:15.750 --> 06:17.668
I BELIEVE IN YOU, GYU-CHEOL!

06:34.727 --> 06:36.938
If she'd just turned a blind eye
back then,

06:37.021 --> 06:39.482
you two would be married by now.

06:39.565 --> 06:40.400
Right?

06:47.115 --> 06:49.826
What's that for?
You're not gonna hit me, are you?

06:54.705 --> 06:56.082
You shouldn't do that.

06:56.666 --> 06:58.960
There's already a stir
about excessive punishment.

06:59.043 --> 07:01.379
If you hit me now,

07:01.462 --> 07:03.131
it'd be a real personal vendetta.

07:06.426 --> 07:08.136
So don't make a move.

07:08.219 --> 07:11.431
If you don't do anything,
nothing will happen--

07:19.730 --> 07:20.898
I'm sorry, Inspector.

07:21.566 --> 07:22.692
I was wrong.

07:23.276 --> 07:24.777
I'm really sorry.

07:24.861 --> 07:27.155
I'm really sorry, Inspector.
Please spare me.

07:27.238 --> 07:29.073
I'm sorry.

07:30.283 --> 07:31.367
I was wrong.

07:31.868 --> 07:33.453
Please spare me just this once.

07:33.536 --> 07:35.455
Please. I'm sorry!

07:35.538 --> 07:37.373
TEACH YOU A LESSON

07:38.332 --> 07:39.750
I'm really sorry.

07:39.834 --> 07:42.753
I'm really sorry, Inspector.
Please spare me.

07:43.379 --> 07:45.339
This is exactly
what I was concerned about.

07:45.423 --> 07:46.716
Only a few days ago,

07:46.799 --> 07:49.427
excessive punishment
drove Lee Chi-ho to attempt suicide.

07:49.510 --> 07:52.388
Now, Cho Gyu-cheol, doing well at school,
has been assaulted.

07:52.472 --> 07:54.140
Why do you think this happened?

07:54.223 --> 07:55.975
The ERPB went to Jinwon High,

07:56.058 --> 07:58.478
targeting Cho Gyu-cheol from the start.

07:59.479 --> 08:01.481
They went there for personal revenge,

08:01.564 --> 08:04.484
looking for an excuse to harass him.

08:05.193 --> 08:06.277
In the end,

08:06.986 --> 08:09.906
it was Lee Chi-ho who was sacrificed.

08:10.656 --> 08:12.658
I won't stand by and allow such cruelty.

08:13.242 --> 08:18.247
I will see to it that the ERPB,
fueled by personal revenge, is dismantled.

08:19.790 --> 08:21.751
With opinion polls

08:21.834 --> 08:26.464
showing that more than 50% of the public
support disbanding the ERPB,

08:26.547 --> 08:29.050
the president
is under considerable pressure

08:29.133 --> 08:31.469
during the lame-duck period of his term.

08:31.969 --> 08:34.972
Despite strong resistance
from the opposition party,

08:35.056 --> 08:37.642
the president
has so far kept the ERPB in place.

08:37.725 --> 08:39.644
-But his approval rating is at 20%.
-Hello?

08:39.727 --> 08:42.438
To navigate this
and bring his term to a steady close…

08:42.522 --> 08:44.315
I'll come see you now.

08:46.567 --> 08:47.985
It's the ERPB!

08:56.452 --> 08:58.204
What are you doing here?

08:58.287 --> 09:00.331
The ERPB shouldn't come
to schools anymore.

09:00.414 --> 09:04.168
We're neither potential criminals
nor targets of personal revenge.

09:04.252 --> 09:06.379
I'm here to investigate Lee Chi-ho's case.

09:06.462 --> 09:09.173
Why would the ERPB investigate

09:09.257 --> 09:11.717
when they caused
Chi-ho to end up like that?

09:11.801 --> 09:15.221
Do you really think
you can conduct a fair investigation?

09:25.898 --> 09:27.858
The ERPB's duties will be suspended

09:27.942 --> 09:32.071
until the investigation
into the student's suicide attempt

09:32.154 --> 09:34.031
at Jinwon High School

09:34.949 --> 09:36.117
is concluded.

09:37.618 --> 09:38.578
Accordingly,

09:38.661 --> 09:41.122
the duties of the ERPB inspectors

09:41.831 --> 09:42.748
will be suspended.

09:51.090 --> 09:53.593
DEPUTY DIRECTOR BONG GEUN-DAE
ERPB

10:34.800 --> 10:36.052
Hey.

10:36.927 --> 10:39.221
Everything is set.
When do we start selling?

10:39.305 --> 10:41.807
Now that the ERPB's out of the way,
we can get started.

10:42.642 --> 10:44.935
First, send samples
to each school's main dealer.

10:46.604 --> 10:48.356
Have them drum up business with those.

10:48.439 --> 10:51.651
Tell them
once a school hits over 100 customers,

10:51.734 --> 10:54.445
we'll start the drop for real.

10:54.528 --> 10:57.281
We'll need a shitload of runners.
Just us isn't enough.

10:58.699 --> 11:01.452
Schools aren't just full of customers.

11:01.535 --> 11:03.204
They've got runners too.

11:03.287 --> 11:05.164
And they're all minors.

11:05.665 --> 11:07.792
No one suspects students.

11:08.292 --> 11:11.212
And even if they get caught,
they'll get out right away.

11:11.712 --> 11:13.214
Best of all,

11:13.714 --> 11:15.341
they're disposable.

11:24.350 --> 11:27.353
I flip sneakers with this guy
for some pocket money.

11:28.020 --> 11:29.730
But there are so many scams

11:29.814 --> 11:32.650
that people want to check them out
in person.

11:34.568 --> 11:36.654
All you have to do is deliver them.

11:39.824 --> 11:40.658
Okay.

11:46.664 --> 11:47.832
Hey.

11:47.915 --> 11:49.834
Oh, hello.

11:51.460 --> 11:53.838
SOYEON GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

11:53.921 --> 11:55.131
They're the right ones.

12:02.179 --> 12:03.389
Yeah, it checks out.

12:04.348 --> 12:05.182
Here.

12:05.891 --> 12:07.810
How was it? Easy, right?

12:07.893 --> 12:08.811
Wanna do it again?

12:09.770 --> 12:10.813
Can I?

12:10.896 --> 12:13.149
If you do, that would be great.

12:20.072 --> 12:22.074
-Hello.
-You're here.

12:22.158 --> 12:23.117
-Gyu-cheol.
-Hey.

12:23.200 --> 12:24.201
You're here.

12:24.285 --> 12:25.786
Go on.

12:35.004 --> 12:36.797
Thanks. Can't wait to wear them.

12:51.061 --> 12:53.314
It's called biodiversity.

12:53.397 --> 12:56.025
There's genetic diversity,
species diversity,

12:56.108 --> 12:57.610
ecosystem diversity…

12:58.360 --> 13:01.030
Jin-hyeok and Ju-won, focus.

13:01.113 --> 13:05.367
Traits within the same species
are determined by genetic information.

13:05.451 --> 13:09.371
So what do we call the part of DNA
that stores this information?

13:09.455 --> 13:11.207
We call it genes.

13:12.124 --> 13:15.169
We're in the middle of class.
What's with everyone today?

13:15.669 --> 13:17.046
Let's all focus.

13:19.632 --> 13:20.925
-Looks good.
-Right?

13:21.008 --> 13:23.219
Hey, is this art class or what?

13:23.302 --> 13:25.262
You're going all out with the brushes.

13:26.013 --> 13:27.598
You don't need this, do you?

13:27.681 --> 13:29.475
You're so pretty with a petite face.

13:29.558 --> 13:30.768
So jealous.

13:30.851 --> 13:33.479
Thanks, but I used to have a big face

13:34.063 --> 13:35.231
like you two.

13:35.314 --> 13:38.275
-Sorry. I actually just lost some weight.
-Really?

13:39.151 --> 13:40.569
What kind of diet was it?

13:41.320 --> 13:42.196
I took pills.

13:43.823 --> 13:45.407
They're hard to get.

13:46.075 --> 13:47.952
Try them, and if they work, let me know.

13:48.035 --> 13:49.662
-Thanks.
-You sure I can have these?

13:49.745 --> 13:51.413
-Yeah.
-This is crazy.

13:51.497 --> 13:52.998
Pitch done.

13:53.082 --> 13:55.334
I need more samples. Please send them.

13:56.460 --> 13:57.294
Oh, ma'am. I--

13:57.378 --> 13:59.839
Oh, Seong-gu.
Seong-jun was in a motorcycle accident.

13:59.922 --> 14:02.883
I have to go to the hospital,
so tell the class to self-study.

14:05.177 --> 14:09.014
Seong-jun got badly hurt
in a motorcycle accident.

14:09.098 --> 14:11.016
Our teacher's gone to the hospital.

14:12.935 --> 14:14.311
Holy shit!

14:14.395 --> 14:17.356
Seong-jun's been delivering like crazy
and actually bought a bike.

14:17.439 --> 14:19.358
Fuck, really? Let me see.

14:20.693 --> 14:22.444
-Let me see.
-What is it? Show me too.

14:22.528 --> 14:23.863
-Get lost.
-Hey, wait.

14:23.946 --> 14:26.198
-I'm a fucking genius.
-Why?

14:26.282 --> 14:28.951
We can just take over
that punk Seong-jun's routes. Right?

14:29.034 --> 14:30.119
Right?

14:32.288 --> 14:33.581
-True.
-We're pros.

14:33.664 --> 14:35.875
Doesn't it feel off in school lately?

14:35.958 --> 14:39.587
More kids are absent or leaving early,
and everyone seems kind of distracted.

14:39.670 --> 14:41.422
I'm so scared of kids these days.

14:41.505 --> 14:42.965
When the ERPB was around,

14:43.048 --> 14:46.343
I didn't exactly feel respected,
but I did feel protected.

14:46.427 --> 14:48.929
It feels like we're back
to how things used to be.

14:57.563 --> 14:58.981
LOOKING FOR ADHD MEDS
OK, CAN DO

15:01.483 --> 15:02.401
NEED BEAUTY PILLS

15:02.484 --> 15:04.320
Wow, fucking hell.

15:05.738 --> 15:10.117
We have about 17 schools in Seoul alone,
with roughly 100 orders from each.

15:10.200 --> 15:12.369
Looks like
all that sample-pushing paid off.

15:17.416 --> 15:19.168
Let's start selling for real today.

15:19.251 --> 15:21.921
Then should I blast it out
on Telegram right now?

15:23.464 --> 15:24.840
CHO GYU-CHEOL
DROP IT ONCE PAID

15:27.468 --> 15:28.469
DROP IT ONCE PAID

15:28.552 --> 15:29.637
DROP IT ONCE PAID

15:45.986 --> 15:47.821
Can I go to the nurse's office?

15:49.031 --> 15:51.450
Ma'am, I've got a terrible headache too.

15:51.533 --> 15:55.120
Ma'am, I'm really sorry,
but my stomach hurts so much. Excuse me.

15:57.456 --> 15:58.582
Ma'am.

15:59.166 --> 16:03.671
Well, my grandma is really sick,
so I've got to rush home now.

16:04.171 --> 16:05.422
I'll see you tomorrow.

16:07.383 --> 16:08.384
Damn it.

16:15.224 --> 16:16.433
Hey, I'm coming too.

16:23.732 --> 16:24.858
Hey, Seong-gu.

16:25.359 --> 16:26.986
I saved one for you.

16:27.611 --> 16:28.445
Here.

17:00.769 --> 17:04.273
Inspector Na Hwa-jin,
please call me when you see this.

17:05.065 --> 17:07.317
I'll be at the convenience store
by my school.

17:19.246 --> 17:21.915
Hi, Seong-gu.
I'm at the convenience store now.

17:21.999 --> 17:23.751
I'm sorry, Inspector.

17:23.834 --> 17:26.420
Something urgent came up at home.

17:27.046 --> 17:30.466
I just remembered
and came home straight away.

17:30.549 --> 17:31.592
Oh, really?

17:33.093 --> 17:34.344
Is everything okay?

17:34.845 --> 17:36.805
Yes, everything's fine.

17:39.349 --> 17:40.184
Yes.

17:42.770 --> 17:44.021
You fucking asshole.

17:46.065 --> 17:49.401
Tell them to drop the product
and send a photo to the customers.

17:50.861 --> 17:51.945
As for him…

17:58.202 --> 17:59.161
He's a good kid.

18:01.455 --> 18:02.372
It's a shame.

19:05.561 --> 19:10.732
SOYEON GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

19:46.977 --> 19:49.521
You must've been very surprised.

19:51.064 --> 19:54.276
Inspector Na Hwa-jin set up
this operation in secret.

19:56.361 --> 19:58.947
So beating up Cho Gyu-cheol
was also part of your plan?

20:01.241 --> 20:04.995
To get conclusive evidence,
Cho Gyu-cheol had to make a move himself.

20:05.078 --> 20:08.707
The ERPB had to be gone
for that to happen, like he wanted.

20:12.336 --> 20:15.964
Of course, I'll take full responsibility
for my actions

20:16.465 --> 20:17.591
once this is all over.

20:19.384 --> 20:20.719
I'll take responsibility too.

20:21.470 --> 20:24.973
My father runs a small training center.
I can work there. Don't worry.

20:31.647 --> 20:33.732
Oh, Minister.

20:33.815 --> 20:39.238
Thank you for all your hard work
on the ERPB over the past two years.

20:39.321 --> 20:40.822
Save it.

20:42.032 --> 20:43.200
I'll also take--

20:43.283 --> 20:44.243
I said save it.

20:45.327 --> 20:47.621
You move like one team, don't you?

20:51.250 --> 20:53.001
I'll be the one taking responsibility.

20:53.502 --> 20:54.836
So you guys

20:55.379 --> 20:56.922
just go ahead as planned.

21:01.134 --> 21:02.135
Take care, sir.

21:05.472 --> 21:06.348
Well…

21:06.431 --> 21:10.435
Then should we request backup first?

21:10.519 --> 21:13.355
How about asking the police
for their cooperation?

21:13.438 --> 21:15.649
It'd be tough for the police
without evidence.

21:15.732 --> 21:19.820
Besides, they'd be reluctant
to enter the school.

21:20.320 --> 21:23.115
It's fine.
If it doesn't work, we'll make it work.

21:23.198 --> 21:25.659
The three of us are enough.
We'll just work nonstop.

21:26.451 --> 21:27.369
Im Han-rim.

21:29.246 --> 21:31.123
What makes you think it's just us three?

21:37.296 --> 21:40.799
I'm Choi Gang-seok from the ERPB.

21:41.300 --> 21:45.262
I know better than anyone
how hard you work

21:45.345 --> 21:50.392
to care for your students every day,
in place of their parents.

21:51.435 --> 21:55.439
So it is with much regret
that I must share such difficult news

21:55.522 --> 21:57.065
once again.

21:57.566 --> 21:58.859
We have confirmed

21:58.942 --> 22:02.321
that a new type of designer drug
is being distributed

22:02.821 --> 22:08.035
among middle and high school students
in Seoul.

22:08.910 --> 22:11.747
If this drug continues to spread
among students,

22:12.247 --> 22:17.085
schools… will suffer irreversible damage,

22:17.169 --> 22:18.754
and the students

22:19.629 --> 22:22.132
will bear
the full weight of the consequences.

22:23.008 --> 22:26.803
I sincerely ask the teachers
who are watching this video.

22:27.637 --> 22:30.474
Please cooperate with the ERPB
one more time

22:31.391 --> 22:33.602
for the sake of our children.

22:34.102 --> 22:36.146
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

22:36.229 --> 22:37.356
Time and again,

22:37.856 --> 22:40.108
we have relied on your sacrifices.

22:41.401 --> 22:42.736
For that, I am sorry

22:43.528 --> 22:44.363
and ashamed.

22:44.446 --> 22:45.822
I WILL NOT FORGET
YOUR KINDNESS

22:45.906 --> 22:47.449
SAVE CLASSROOMS
SAVE TEACHERS

22:47.532 --> 22:50.327
SCHOOL IS STILL A STRUGGLE

22:50.410 --> 22:52.871
MS. CHOI! I MISS YOU
I MISS YOUR SMILE SO MUCH

23:04.883 --> 23:07.094
YOUR WISHES WILL NOT BE FORGOTTEN

23:07.177 --> 23:08.762
WE WILL HONOR THEM

23:09.388 --> 23:14.601
I agree with the ERPB
that school must be the safest place.

23:14.684 --> 23:18.605
I would like to cooperate
with their request.

23:20.482 --> 23:21.858
Here.

23:22.567 --> 23:24.069
By the way,

23:24.152 --> 23:26.029
what about other teachers?

23:27.072 --> 23:29.032
No one else has contacted us yet.

23:29.116 --> 23:30.367
I see.

24:04.359 --> 24:07.654
We collected these
from each of our schools.

24:11.366 --> 24:13.160
I know it couldn't have been easy.

24:14.035 --> 24:15.120
Thank you for coming.

24:18.415 --> 24:20.500
But this drug…

24:21.501 --> 24:23.545
What if it's already circulating
in schools?

24:23.628 --> 24:25.088
Please don't worry about that.

24:25.589 --> 24:26.798
That will never happen.

24:28.383 --> 24:29.217
Right?

24:30.385 --> 24:31.219
Yes.

24:35.307 --> 24:37.184
-Oh, there.
-He's out.

24:47.277 --> 24:48.111
All right.

24:48.195 --> 24:49.362
I'll see you later.

24:49.863 --> 24:50.947
Oh, hold on.

24:52.657 --> 24:53.700
Here it is.

24:53.783 --> 24:55.118
Come here.

25:00.165 --> 25:00.999
All good?

25:01.082 --> 25:02.250
-Good luck.
-Okay.

25:02.751 --> 25:06.421
It's a vitamin and a diet pill.
A double win for us.

25:06.505 --> 25:08.840
-Does this mean we'll be like Yu-ri?
-Of course.

25:08.924 --> 25:10.342
We'll lose at least 5 kg.

25:10.425 --> 25:12.093
-It's them.
-Oh, they're out.

25:12.177 --> 25:13.053
Get ready.

25:13.136 --> 25:14.471
What should we do?

25:14.554 --> 25:17.140
When they come out this way,
hit me on the head.

25:17.224 --> 25:18.141
-Okay, a slap.
-No.

25:18.225 --> 25:19.684
-What? A slap?
-Hey.

25:20.769 --> 25:22.687
-No, on the head.
-Hey.

25:22.771 --> 25:23.939
Hey.

25:24.022 --> 25:26.191
-I'm sorry.
-You little shit.

25:27.275 --> 25:28.109
Going somewhere?

25:29.486 --> 25:30.445
-Come here.
-Go. Run.

25:32.072 --> 25:33.406
If you don't have any cash…

25:33.990 --> 25:34.824
Yes.

25:34.908 --> 25:37.494
-Give me something valuable, like a phone.
-Yes.

25:37.577 --> 25:38.870
Or a watch!

25:39.371 --> 25:42.666
Or at least some vitamin C.

25:42.749 --> 25:43.750
I have some.

25:43.833 --> 25:45.460
-You do?
-Yes, I've got some here.

25:45.544 --> 25:47.212
Vitamin C!

25:47.295 --> 25:49.172
-Here.
-Here you go.

25:49.673 --> 25:50.590
This is all we have.

25:51.466 --> 25:54.678
I'll tail that student at the front,
over there.

25:54.761 --> 25:56.721
I'll take the one with the brown backpack.

25:57.430 --> 25:58.515
What about the rest?

25:58.598 --> 25:59.599
Don't worry.

26:00.183 --> 26:02.936
I've called in backup
from kids who used to be experts

26:03.645 --> 26:04.938
at shaking people down.

26:05.021 --> 26:06.231
Huh?

26:11.987 --> 26:15.865
Yes, we've collected all the samples.
We'll move on to the next step.

26:15.949 --> 26:18.785
-I'll send them the orders on Telegram.
-Okay.

26:21.955 --> 26:23.331
LOOKING FOR ADHD MEDS
HOW MUCH?

26:23.415 --> 26:25.208
LOOKING FOR HEADACHE SUPPLEMENTS

26:28.336 --> 26:30.880
Recently classified
as a temporary controlled substance,

26:30.964 --> 26:34.009
this new designer drug
has been circulating among students

26:34.092 --> 26:35.468
in place of Heart Pills.

26:36.303 --> 26:39.848
These pills were discovered
on school grounds by teachers

26:39.931 --> 26:41.808
and handed over to the ERPB.

26:41.891 --> 26:44.269
As a result
of tracing the distribution route,

26:44.352 --> 26:47.439
the suspect has been identified

26:48.398 --> 26:50.650
as Cho Gyu-cheol of Jinwon High School.

26:51.610 --> 26:53.778
Accordingly, as of this moment,

26:54.362 --> 26:56.573
the suspension of ERPB's duties
has been lifted,

26:56.656 --> 26:59.701
and inspectors
will also resume active duty.

27:05.790 --> 27:07.959
-Hey, put this on me.
-Oh, come on.

27:09.044 --> 27:10.003
Okay.

27:10.629 --> 27:14.883
The suspect has been identified
as Cho Gyu-cheol of Jinwon High School.

27:14.966 --> 27:16.593
Hey, it's the ERPB.

27:38.365 --> 27:40.533
For God's sake. Give it here.

27:40.617 --> 27:42.827
Hey, be careful.

28:22.409 --> 28:24.411
Inspector, this is the only one
that's closed.

28:37.841 --> 28:38.675
Don't open it!

28:46.850 --> 28:48.143
Hold your breath!

28:51.229 --> 28:52.230
Are you okay?

29:06.536 --> 29:09.122
Hey, looks like they actually opened it.

29:09.205 --> 29:11.750
Hey, did you get a good taste?
Fucking good, right?

29:11.833 --> 29:13.084
Tell me if you need more!

29:13.168 --> 29:14.669
-Hey!
-You fucking asshole!

29:14.753 --> 29:16.755
-What, dumbass?
-Idiot, you can't catch us.

29:16.838 --> 29:18.006
I'll go catch them.

29:18.089 --> 29:20.258
Fucking idiots. Come on, let's go.

29:22.677 --> 29:24.137
You know what?

29:26.055 --> 29:27.682
I can fly.

29:28.266 --> 29:29.100
What?

29:30.185 --> 29:32.812
Im Han-rim, ready for high-rise descent.

29:34.481 --> 29:36.191
-Jump!
-Hey, Im Han-rim.

29:40.153 --> 29:41.654
What the fuck?

29:41.738 --> 29:43.364
-Fuck.
-Goddamn it.

29:44.073 --> 29:44.908
My back.

29:47.702 --> 29:49.120
Damn it.

29:50.246 --> 29:51.331
Fucking hell.

29:54.250 --> 29:55.376
Damn, my back.

29:59.964 --> 30:01.633
Im Han-rim, are you okay?

30:04.219 --> 30:05.053
Hey, Im Han-rim!

30:06.471 --> 30:08.306
I've got this. You go ahead, sir.

30:09.098 --> 30:09.933
Okay.

30:10.016 --> 30:12.143
-Oh man, my head.
-Fuck.

30:18.983 --> 30:20.318
For God's sake.

30:22.403 --> 30:24.697
I'll take care of Inspector Im.
You go ahead.

30:24.781 --> 30:25.990
Go on, hurry.

30:28.034 --> 30:30.411
-Okay, good.
-Thought I was a fucking goner.

30:30.495 --> 30:32.330
This bitch is goddamn crazy.

30:32.413 --> 30:33.373
Are you okay?

30:34.791 --> 30:35.625
Damn it.

30:35.708 --> 30:39.170
Depending on your attitude,

30:39.254 --> 30:41.464
I can be an angel or a devil.

30:43.049 --> 30:44.259
Now I'm going to be

30:45.218 --> 30:46.386
a devil.

30:48.596 --> 30:49.722
You fucking…

30:55.019 --> 30:57.021
-It's a real knife!
-Fuck off.

30:57.522 --> 30:59.232
Fucking hell!

31:08.658 --> 31:10.118
-Whoa.
-Move.

31:10.201 --> 31:11.911
What the hell is that?

31:12.412 --> 31:14.664
-She's fucking out of it.
-Damn.

31:14.747 --> 31:16.749
Hey, hit me. Come on.

31:17.333 --> 31:19.043
-Damn it.
-My bad.

31:19.127 --> 31:21.045
Take this, you fucking bitch.

31:21.129 --> 31:23.214
-It hurts.
-Fucking bitch.

31:23.298 --> 31:24.632
-Die, fucker.
-Hands off her!

31:24.716 --> 31:26.092
It hurts.

31:34.225 --> 31:35.685
You asshole. You fucker.

31:39.731 --> 31:42.275
You son of a bitch. Come here, fucker!

31:42.358 --> 31:43.902
-Fucking asshole!
-You bastard!

31:47.488 --> 31:48.489
You fucker!

31:58.666 --> 32:01.377
Inspector Im Han-rim!

32:02.420 --> 32:04.047
Are you okay?

32:06.299 --> 32:08.217
You're so fucking hot.

32:09.886 --> 32:10.803
What?

32:24.567 --> 32:25.401
Hey!

32:26.569 --> 32:27.946
Hey, come here. This way.

32:29.656 --> 32:30.615
Over here, asshole.

32:30.698 --> 32:31.699
Me?

32:33.368 --> 32:36.871
I don't have time, so let's be quick.
You get a punch each.

32:49.425 --> 32:51.135
Damn it.

32:52.720 --> 32:54.013
Goddamn it.

33:12.949 --> 33:14.409
Damn it.

33:16.369 --> 33:18.496
You punk, this is dangerous, you know.

33:21.249 --> 33:23.251
-Let's take a break on the steps.
-I'm sorry.

33:23.334 --> 33:24.460
-It's okay.
-Sorry.

33:24.544 --> 33:25.586
-Sorry, wait.
-Careful.

33:25.670 --> 33:27.380
No, I can go. I can make it there.

33:27.463 --> 33:28.297
Sit down here.

33:29.716 --> 33:30.550
Slowly.

33:32.051 --> 33:34.429
Do you feel dizzy? What should I do?

33:34.929 --> 33:36.764
Whoa, are you okay?

33:57.493 --> 33:59.328
Fucking hell.

34:00.955 --> 34:02.331
It's just like that day.

34:28.775 --> 34:30.068
Can you explain?

34:31.861 --> 34:33.738
Why didn't you call the police?

34:34.363 --> 34:38.076
I wanted to give you a chance.

34:39.994 --> 34:41.120
Turn yourself in.

34:46.334 --> 34:48.669
So you haven't told anyone yet.

34:50.505 --> 34:52.340
I'll make sure not to waste the chance

34:53.716 --> 34:54.717
you gave me.

34:57.345 --> 34:58.471
Gyu-cheol.

35:02.058 --> 35:05.353
You really don't know anything, do you?

35:06.437 --> 35:08.356
Why would I turn myself in?

35:08.439 --> 35:11.067
I'll be able to get out soon
because I'm a minor.

35:11.150 --> 35:13.319
And if it's ruled
involuntary manslaughter,

35:13.402 --> 35:15.404
two years in prison should be enough.

35:15.488 --> 35:18.658
I come from a broken home,
and I had no motive to kill you.

35:18.741 --> 35:20.201
Most of all…

35:22.954 --> 35:25.039
I was in love with you.

35:25.748 --> 35:26.999
Gyu-cheol, you--

35:42.390 --> 35:44.684
I can just sell this again in two years.

35:45.852 --> 35:49.814
Thanks to you, I came back to school.
And I realized this is the best market.

35:51.107 --> 35:52.316
But it's too bad.

35:54.152 --> 35:55.653
You won't be getting married.

35:56.821 --> 35:57.947
You shouldn't

35:58.948 --> 35:59.866
do this.

36:26.517 --> 36:29.312
I guess I can't beat an ERPB inspector.

36:32.690 --> 36:34.567
I'm sorry for everything.

36:35.818 --> 36:36.694
All right.

36:38.112 --> 36:39.488
Then you're getting

36:39.989 --> 36:41.365
one painful punch.

36:41.866 --> 36:42.867
Don't move,

36:42.950 --> 36:45.578
or someone else might die at this school.

36:47.121 --> 36:50.541
Stop resisting,
you fucking son of a bitch.

36:55.463 --> 36:56.505
No!

37:01.177 --> 37:02.220
Inspector.

37:04.472 --> 37:06.515
No, wait. Hold on.

37:06.599 --> 37:08.017
Are you okay?

37:09.936 --> 37:10.770
What is it?

37:18.444 --> 37:19.695
I'll spare Seong-gu.

37:21.447 --> 37:23.241
When you see Ms. Choi,

37:24.784 --> 37:26.077
please tell her

37:27.036 --> 37:27.870
I'm sorry.

37:45.263 --> 37:46.097
Hey.

37:46.764 --> 37:47.682
Look.

38:12.873 --> 38:14.417
Stop it!

38:14.500 --> 38:17.044
Please stop!

38:24.051 --> 38:25.303
Oh, what do I do now?

38:30.224 --> 38:31.934
Help me sober up.

38:32.018 --> 38:33.394
-What?
-Do something.

38:36.314 --> 38:38.524
This won't pass
as involuntary manslaughter.

38:39.734 --> 38:42.403
Or self-defense.

38:44.030 --> 38:46.198
I can't live here anymore, can I?

38:47.658 --> 38:49.744
Well, there are schools
in other countries too.

39:11.682 --> 39:13.476
Fuck!

39:17.855 --> 39:19.398
Who the fuck are you?

39:19.482 --> 39:22.151
Who do you think?
I'm ERPB Inspector Im Han-rim.

39:26.864 --> 39:28.824
You fucking bitch!

39:34.080 --> 39:34.914
Let go.

39:35.539 --> 39:37.208
Let go, you fucking…

39:40.086 --> 39:42.338
You punk. You sure talk a lot, don't you?

39:43.089 --> 39:44.924
Now it's my turn.

40:08.197 --> 40:09.031
Go ahead.

40:18.958 --> 40:20.918
You weren't supposed to grab it.

40:21.752 --> 40:23.587
You just missed another chance.

40:31.262 --> 40:32.555
Listen carefully.

40:32.638 --> 40:36.517
All Koreans have an equal right to receive
an education suited to their abilities.

40:37.852 --> 40:41.147
And through that,
they have the right to be happy.

40:43.983 --> 40:47.653
That means we come to school to be happy.

40:49.864 --> 40:50.906
So,

40:51.449 --> 40:53.534
any bastard who gets in the way of that…

41:01.208 --> 41:02.543
no matter who they are…

41:04.420 --> 41:07.047
will be taught a lesson.

41:21.896 --> 41:23.397
I'm sorry.

41:24.106 --> 41:25.191
Please spare me.

41:25.274 --> 41:26.734
I have no intention of doing so.

41:26.817 --> 41:27.860
Please.

41:28.736 --> 41:30.112
Please give me another chance.

41:31.280 --> 41:33.866
Chances aren't something you're given.

41:35.075 --> 41:37.453
They come to those who want them.

41:41.832 --> 41:45.711
I wanted to give you a chance.

41:47.588 --> 41:49.131
But Gyu-cheol,

41:50.508 --> 41:52.009
the thing is,

41:53.511 --> 41:55.054
chances aren't given to you.

41:58.265 --> 42:00.809
Chances only come to those who want them.

42:05.814 --> 42:06.899
Wow.

42:08.651 --> 42:10.694
You really were made for each other.

42:14.240 --> 42:16.825
Do you know
what Choi Ga-yun's last words were?

42:19.286 --> 42:20.454
"Gyu-cheol,

42:21.330 --> 42:23.207
you shouldn't do this."

42:26.961 --> 42:29.672
Why the fuck shouldn't I?

42:30.673 --> 42:32.341
Don't bullshit me.

42:33.300 --> 42:35.261
Don't pretend you care.

42:36.345 --> 42:39.056
I don't need a stupid chance.
Just kill me instead.

42:40.224 --> 42:42.518
Go on. Kill me.

42:43.686 --> 42:45.062
I said kill me.

43:18.220 --> 43:20.973
Gyu-cheol, you shouldn't do this.

43:21.849 --> 43:23.100
It's okay.

43:26.437 --> 43:27.938
Let's start over.

43:46.498 --> 43:50.044
This is the last chance
Ms. Choi is giving you.

44:05.100 --> 44:07.645
Fuck!

44:09.605 --> 44:12.149
Who do you think you all are?

44:12.983 --> 44:15.152
You think you're Jesus?

44:15.235 --> 44:17.029
A damn Buddha, or what?

44:17.112 --> 44:20.407
Fuck!

44:28.040 --> 44:29.750
We're adults, you punk. Adults.

44:48.018 --> 44:49.353
I did you proud, right?

46:03.302 --> 46:04.636
Shall I get you a stapler?

46:08.098 --> 46:09.183
Oh man.

46:10.058 --> 46:11.560
Don't make me laugh.

46:28.577 --> 46:29.870
For fuck's sake!

46:29.953 --> 46:31.038
I'm going! Damn it.

46:32.206 --> 46:34.124
-You'll be okay.
-Thank you.

46:35.918 --> 46:38.337
-Let go of me.
-Let go, damn it.

46:39.004 --> 46:40.214
Fucking hell.

46:40.297 --> 46:41.715
I'm going, man!

46:49.223 --> 46:50.307
You

46:51.016 --> 46:52.643
are being charged

46:53.560 --> 46:55.103
with violations of the ERPB Act,

46:56.230 --> 46:57.564
the Narcotics Control Act…

47:00.275 --> 47:01.276
and…

47:03.904 --> 47:06.281
the Punishment of Violence Act,

47:06.782 --> 47:08.367
as well as attempted murder.

47:14.873 --> 47:16.208
Therefore, as of this moment,

47:17.125 --> 47:19.002
you're expelled from Jinwon High…

47:21.797 --> 47:24.508
and you'll never set foot here again.

47:29.388 --> 47:30.472
Take him away.

47:31.139 --> 47:33.767
-The ERPB will also follow protocol.
-Yes, sir.

47:47.281 --> 47:48.824
Hey, what happened to you?

47:50.909 --> 47:51.743
Were you stabbed?

47:51.827 --> 47:53.495
-Well, yeah. I'm fine.
-Are you okay?

47:53.579 --> 47:55.122
-That bastard!
-Hey, stop him!

47:56.248 --> 47:57.249
Hey, you punk!

47:57.332 --> 47:59.251
-That's my son-in-law, you punk!
-Stop.

47:59.334 --> 48:02.254
Get out here! You punk, come here!

48:02.337 --> 48:04.298
-Come here!
-Go.

48:04.381 --> 48:05.799
-Minister, please.
-Please go!

48:05.883 --> 48:06.800
Come here, bastard!

48:06.884 --> 48:09.344
-Hold on, Minister.
-Come back! Hey!

48:10.012 --> 48:11.513
-Hey!
-Minister, wait.

48:11.597 --> 48:13.557
-Are you okay?
-Are you all right?

48:13.640 --> 48:14.975
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

48:15.058 --> 48:16.101
Fellow citizens,

48:16.602 --> 48:19.104
do you know the definition of education?

48:19.938 --> 48:23.525
"The teaching of knowledge and skills
and the cultivation of character."

48:24.026 --> 48:26.069
This is what education is.

48:26.820 --> 48:29.865
Yes, good universities and good jobs
are important.

48:29.948 --> 48:31.491
But what's more important

48:31.575 --> 48:35.871
is nurturing a person's dignity
and moral integrity.

48:35.954 --> 48:40.042
This is putting the true meaning
of education into practice.

48:41.501 --> 48:46.256
However, the current education system
of our country has strayed too far

48:46.340 --> 48:48.467
from this purpose and is deeply broken.

48:49.968 --> 48:52.888
Nonetheless, in the midst of this reality,

48:53.847 --> 48:57.768
most teachers in this country
continue to fulfill their calling,

48:57.851 --> 49:01.688
teaching children and trying to guide them
toward the right path.

49:10.781 --> 49:13.450
How long must we continue to see

49:14.284 --> 49:15.494
students and teachers

49:16.244 --> 49:19.289
never making it back home

49:20.666 --> 49:22.334
from school?

49:24.836 --> 49:28.382
The ERPB will uphold
the value of education

49:29.174 --> 49:30.676
and protect victims…

49:32.594 --> 49:35.847
until schools are no longer places
of fear and anxiety

49:36.598 --> 49:38.266
and become truly safe.

49:38.350 --> 49:41.728
We will continue to exist
until our education system is restored…

49:44.106 --> 49:45.524
to its intended state.

49:56.535 --> 50:01.289
I MISS YOUR SMILE SO MUCH

50:09.214 --> 50:11.967
Ga-yun, it must be nice.

50:13.468 --> 50:15.387
So many people still remember you.

50:18.432 --> 50:20.767
THE LATE CHOI GA-YUN

50:23.478 --> 50:24.604
Are you crying?

50:27.024 --> 50:29.234
Hey, who's crying, punk?

50:29.901 --> 50:31.111
I shed no tears.

50:32.279 --> 50:34.656
Well, I heard
you're a man who cries easily.

50:35.282 --> 50:36.450
Who said that?

50:37.034 --> 50:37.993
Ga-yun did.

50:38.869 --> 50:40.037
My goodness.

50:40.537 --> 50:41.872
She said you cried

50:41.955 --> 50:45.751
on the day the stray cat
you were looking after was adopted.

50:46.877 --> 50:48.003
You cried for a month.

50:48.086 --> 50:49.337
-No, that's…
-Oh.

50:50.047 --> 50:51.715
That's actually kind of cute.

50:51.798 --> 50:53.759
He's very cute. He's also very loving.

50:53.842 --> 50:56.011
-And very tearful.
-You're adorable, sir.

50:56.094 --> 50:57.304
Seriously, you punks.

50:57.387 --> 51:01.016
Hey, did you…
finish the report on Jinwon High?

51:01.099 --> 51:02.434
-Come on.
-Send it over now.

51:02.517 --> 51:04.061
He switched back into boss mode.

51:04.144 --> 51:05.228
Can he do this?

51:05.312 --> 51:06.563
This is workplace bullying.

51:06.646 --> 51:09.066
Bullying, my ass.
If you don't want to work, say so.

51:09.149 --> 51:11.401
Got a problem?
We'll settle it under Yatcha rules.

51:11.485 --> 51:13.153
I'll check and get back to you. Bye.

51:13.236 --> 51:14.446
Let's head down now.

51:14.946 --> 51:16.907
We have a lot of work to do, but no time.

51:16.990 --> 51:18.909
I can't be the only one working here.

51:19.409 --> 51:21.244
Minister, fists down, please.

51:21.328 --> 51:22.412
Let's go.

51:22.496 --> 51:24.456
-Come on, Inspector Im Han-rim.
-Okay.

51:25.540 --> 51:28.043
-He scares me the most these days.
-Same.

51:28.126 --> 51:30.962
Whenever he catches my eye,
he asks for a report. It's tiring.

51:31.046 --> 51:32.714
He acts like he's the boss.

51:32.798 --> 51:34.466
Haven't you sent the report?

51:34.966 --> 51:36.843
I can send it today, can't I?

51:36.927 --> 51:38.637
What are you waiting for? Come on.

51:38.720 --> 51:40.764
-Okay, we're coming.
-Yeah, coming.

51:40.847 --> 51:44.226
And Minister, you can't ever mention
the Yatcha rules anywhere.

51:44.309 --> 51:46.394
-Okay?
-Yeah, okay.

51:47.020 --> 51:48.730
-Careful.
-Yeah.

51:51.024 --> 51:52.025
What's wrong?

51:52.109 --> 51:53.693
-Why would you hold my hand?
-Well…

51:54.486 --> 51:57.739
I thought you might trip over a stone.
It was dangerous.

51:58.532 --> 51:59.825
Still, why hold my hand?

51:59.908 --> 52:01.284
Didn't you hold mine first?

52:01.368 --> 52:02.536
No, I didn't.

52:02.619 --> 52:04.538
I let you hold my hand,
and I get told off?

52:04.621 --> 52:05.872
-You "let" me?
-What?

52:05.956 --> 52:06.873
You "let" me?

52:06.957 --> 52:09.042
-What's with them?
-What's with the "let"?

52:09.126 --> 52:11.336
They have feelings for each other,

52:11.837 --> 52:14.256
but they don't seem to know it.

52:14.339 --> 52:15.173
I see.

52:16.967 --> 52:18.301
Do something.

52:18.802 --> 52:20.345
-What do I do?
-Help me sober up.

52:20.428 --> 52:22.347
-What should I do?
-Just do anything.

52:22.430 --> 52:23.390
Do something.

52:23.473 --> 52:24.933
-Do anything.
-What should I do?

52:25.016 --> 52:26.351
I'm sorry.

52:37.070 --> 52:37.988
Why hold my hand?

52:38.613 --> 52:41.158
-I let you hold my hand, and you…
-You "let" me?

52:43.160 --> 52:45.579
Could you guys hurry? You should run.

52:45.662 --> 52:47.539
-All right, punk.
-Yeah, okay.

52:48.081 --> 52:49.124
Should we hold hands?

52:49.207 --> 52:50.375
What? No.

52:50.458 --> 52:53.170
Why are you flustered?
You must be lonely these days.

52:53.253 --> 52:56.256
-Guys, stop chatting and hurry up!
-We're on our way!

52:58.258 --> 53:00.135
KANGJU HIGH SCHOOL SEO TAE-HUN WINS GOLD

53:05.849 --> 53:06.683
Next.

53:11.313 --> 53:12.564
Next!

53:13.732 --> 53:15.942
Hurry up, you bastard.

53:16.943 --> 53:19.279
Seriously, these fucking assholes.

53:19.863 --> 53:22.199
You guys get all these perks thanks to me.

53:23.783 --> 53:25.285
And Yeong-cheol, you fucker.

53:25.785 --> 53:26.620
Yeah.

53:26.703 --> 53:29.456
You're all going to Hanguk University
because I got scouted.

53:29.539 --> 53:32.500
Like a fucking two-for-one deal, idiot.

53:33.001 --> 53:34.878
But you don't even fucking pay me back?

53:34.961 --> 53:38.298
You should make up for the money
I missed out on by not going pro.

53:41.843 --> 53:42.844
Whatever.

53:43.428 --> 53:44.930
You fucking assholes.

53:45.013 --> 53:46.681
Poor fuckers can pay the hard way.

53:48.642 --> 53:49.476
Hey.

54:06.243 --> 54:07.619
You high school punks.

54:07.702 --> 54:10.413
You should be studying, you brats.

54:10.997 --> 54:13.250
Guys, get up.

54:13.917 --> 54:15.126
I said get up.

54:15.210 --> 54:16.544
It's okay. Get up.

54:17.045 --> 54:18.129
Come on, get up.

54:19.005 --> 54:22.008
I'm Deputy Director Bong Geun-dae
from the ERPB.

54:22.092 --> 54:23.385
From this moment on,

54:24.261 --> 54:25.720
the ERPB

54:27.305 --> 54:28.598
will teach you a lesson.

54:31.309 --> 54:32.143
Get up.

54:32.852 --> 54:33.728
I said get up.

54:33.812 --> 54:35.397
You too. Step back.

54:36.606 --> 54:37.732
Get up.

54:37.816 --> 54:39.276
I said get up.

54:45.615 --> 54:46.491
Yes?

54:50.412 --> 54:52.038
-You told me to get up.
-No.

54:52.122 --> 54:53.873
No, I said "get off" me.

54:53.957 --> 54:55.125
You said to get up.

54:55.208 --> 54:57.210
-No, I said, "Get off."
-Oh man.

54:57.294 --> 54:59.296
-You said to get up.
-No, I said, "Get off."

54:59.379 --> 55:02.299
-I said…
-Take your hands off him. Now!

55:02.966 --> 55:03.800
Who's that?

55:05.552 --> 55:06.636
Get up.

55:08.138 --> 55:09.306
Get up!

55:10.765 --> 55:13.184
If they listen to words,
you teach with words.

55:13.268 --> 55:17.188
If they listen only after a beating,
then you teach by beating.

55:25.697 --> 55:26.656
Are you okay?

55:26.740 --> 55:28.658
-Are you okay? Are you hurt?
-I'm fine.

55:28.742 --> 55:29.951
-Why, you little…
-No, stop.

55:30.035 --> 55:32.162
No, stop. You can't.

55:32.245 --> 55:33.246
-This is funny?
-Don't.

55:33.330 --> 55:34.831
-You'll get hurt. Don't.
-Why not?

55:34.914 --> 55:38.418
Man, look at these punks.

55:38.918 --> 55:42.088
You athlete punks
are supposed to be training.

55:42.881 --> 55:46.134
Even with the ERPB here,
you still don't know how to behave.

55:46.217 --> 55:47.177
Do you?

55:48.928 --> 55:49.804
What are you doing?

55:52.849 --> 55:55.977
Students shall have no power of any kind,

55:56.061 --> 55:58.646
even if they represent the country.

55:59.481 --> 56:00.523
You may not know,

56:00.607 --> 56:04.319
but the newly revived ERPB
still has no limits

56:04.903 --> 56:06.488
on how we educate.

56:07.364 --> 56:09.491
So from this moment on…

56:11.618 --> 56:13.036
we will teach you a lesson.

56:30.428 --> 56:33.223
TEACH YOU A LESSON

56:56.913 --> 56:57.747
I'm fine.

57:01.167 --> 57:03.086
You think this is it for me?

57:04.671 --> 57:05.880
Mr. Hwang!

57:05.964 --> 57:07.590
Oh dear.

57:07.674 --> 57:09.092
-Let's get you up.
-Are you okay?

57:11.678 --> 57:12.679
Mark my words.

57:13.179 --> 57:16.516
I'll be back no matter what.
The first thing I'll do is take you down.

57:21.438 --> 57:23.940
When Cho Gyu-cheol gave you the recording,

57:24.899 --> 57:26.025
you knew what happened.

57:26.985 --> 57:28.778
You should've stopped then.

57:29.571 --> 57:33.616
It's adults like you
who turn young students into monsters.

57:34.117 --> 57:37.120
If you can't be a good adult,
at least don't be a bad one.

57:38.121 --> 57:40.707
And what about you? Are you a good adult?

57:40.790 --> 57:43.710
You think I won't find anything on you?
Damn…

57:57.599 --> 57:58.433
I guess

58:00.018 --> 58:03.188
I'm not a good adult either.

59:28.773 --> 59:31.734
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
